// Boot/cleanup hooks for the Cmd+F takeover feature. Wires the intercept
// layer (capture-phase keydown) to the bar UI mount and back to the
// existing saved-query pipeline (content.highlight.ts).
//
// invokeBehaviour calls boot(settings) on every settings refresh; boot
// reinstalls the intercept with the latest settings closure. Cleanup
// happens through cleanup() which is called from switchOffCleanup.

